    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="page">
      <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="page-title">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Cat care essentials</p>
          <h1 id="page-title">FAQ for curious cat people</h1>
          <p class="intro">
            Practical answers for everyday feline care, from feeding routines to
            enrichment and vet visits.
          </p>
        </div>

        <aside class="stats-card" aria-label="Cat care reminder">
